{"<b class=\"text-gray-300\">Best for:</b> patient traders who think in ranges and value areas and want fewer, bigger decisions.":"<b class=\"text-gray-300\">最适合：</b>擅长看区间和价值区域、想要更少但更大决定的有耐心的交易员。","<b class=\"text-gray-300\">Best for:</b> precise, early entries on lower timeframes and traders who want to see every change in control.":"<b class=\"text-gray-300\">最适合：</b>想在较小周期上精准早入场、想看到每一次控制权变化的交易员。","<b class=\"text-gray-300\">Best for:</b> traders who want clean, classic market structure with the order flow that proves each break.":"<b class=\"text-gray-300\">最适合：</b>想要清晰、经典的市场结构，并用订单流证明每一次突破的交易员。","<b class=\"text-gray-300\">Best for:</b> traders who want one clean chart instead of three indicators, and want to see the odds before they decide.":"<b class=\"text-gray-300\">最适合：</b>想用一张干净的图表代替三个指标，并在决定前先看到胜率的交易员。","<span class=\"gold-text\">Learn the language first.</span>":"<span class=\"gold-text\">先学会这套语言。</span>","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>Balance Control lines: green = buyers, red = sellers":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>Balance Control 线：绿色 = 买方，红色 = 卖方","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>Candle compass: {0} candle types with tested odds":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>K线指南针：{0}种K线，附带已测试的胜率","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>Candle conviction colouring":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>K线信心着色","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>GMC lines with their stats, ★ gold = held in both test periods":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>GMC 线及其统计，★ 金色 = 在两个测试期都有效","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>One MAP table: the live read + the test data":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>一张 MAP 表：实时读数 + 测试数据","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>Pullback and resumption levels, numbered by tier":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>回调和恢复水平，按层级编号","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>Pullback zones: P–MP after strong candles, BAL–MD after weak ones":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>回调区：强K线后看 P–MP，弱K线后看 BAL–MD","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>Swing protected levels for your stop":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>为你的止损准备的波段保护位","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>The earliest of the three to react":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>三者中反应最早","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>Urgency levels and structural voids":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">▸</span>紧迫度等级和结构性空白","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">▸</span>Accelerator candles and un-auctioned prices":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">▸</span>加速K线和未被拍卖的价格","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">▸</span>Break grade from volume and delta":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">▸</span>按成交量和 delta 给突破打分","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">▸</span>Footprint delta on supported plans":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">▸</span>支持的套餐可用 footprint delta","<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">▸</span>Strong sweeps marked separately":"<span class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">▸</span>强力扫单单独标出","<span class=\"text-green-400\">▸</span>Balance boxes coloured by absorption":"<span class=\"text-green-400\">▸</span>平衡框按吸收程度着色","<span class=\"text-green-400\">▸</span>Failed boxes cleaned up automatically":"<span class=\"text-green-400\">▸</span>失败的框会自动清除","<span class=\"text-green-400\">▸</span>The calmest, most selective of the three":"<span class=\"text-green-400\">▸</span>三者中最平静、最挑剔","<span class=\"text-green-400\">▸</span>Two box styles to test: growing or fixed":"<span class=\"text-green-400\">▸</span>两种框样式可测试：增长型或固定型","A body close":"实体收盘","A break that matters":"有意义的突破","A swing forms where one side's push ran dry and the other side answered with a close of its own. That turning point is where the losing side last defended — real orders sat there. MMM Pro s watches every swing, without filters, and waits for a <b class=\"text-white\">body close</b> through one.":"当一方的推动力耗尽，另一方用自己的一根收盘做出回应，就会形成波段。这个转折点是失败的一方最后防守的地方——那里有真实的订单。MMM Pro s 不加任何过滤，盯着每一个波段，等待<b class=\"text-white\">实体收盘</b>穿过它。","A warning dot before red-folder news, filled from the free <a href=\"/news/\" class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)] hover:underline\">MMM News Calendar</a>.":"红色重要新闻前出现的提醒小点，数据来自免费的<a href=\"/news/\" class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)] hover:underline\">MMM 新闻日历</a>。","A wick":"影线","A wick through a swing is a <b class=\"text-white\">sweep</b>: the orders there were taken, but the market refused the new price. A close through it is a <b class=\"text-white\">break</b>: the defenders were absorbed. Every break is graded by the order flow behind it — how much volume came in and whether delta (aggressive buying minus aggressive selling) agreed with the move.":"影线穿过波段是<b class=\"text-white\">扫单</b>：那里的订单被吃掉了，但市场拒绝了新价格。收盘穿过它则是<b class=\"text-white\">突破</b>：防守方被吸收了。每次突破都按背后的订单流打分——进来了多少成交量，以及 delta（主动买入减主动卖出）是否与走势一致。","All three engines <b class=\"text-white\">in one picture</b>, with the test results written next to what it draws.":"三个引擎<b class=\"text-white\">合在一张图里</b>，测试结果就写在它画出的内容旁边。","All three, plus the tested odds on the chart":"三个全有，再加上图表上的已测试胜率","An optional filter that only confirms a pullback once the market has truly stretched both ways — or switch it off for raw structure.":"一个可选过滤器：只有市场真正向两个方向都拉伸过，才确认回调。也可以关掉它，看原始结构。","Balance zone break illustration":"平衡区突破示意图","Balance zones (boxes)":"平衡区（框）","Balance-zone break engine":"平衡区突破引擎","Boxes + candles + swings":"框 + K线 + 波段","BuPO{0} / BePO{1} · T#":"BuPO{0} / BePO{1} · T#","Build the structure on a higher timeframe and trade it on your execution chart, without switching charts.":"在更大的周期上建立结构，在你的执行图表上交易，不用来回切换图表。","Built the same way underneath":"底层构造相同","Buy demand meets sell offers":"买入需求遇上卖出报价","Buyers in a hurry lift the sell offers sitting above price. While the offers at a price are bigger than the demand, price holds. When demand eats the last offer at that price, the next offer is <b class=\"text-white\">higher</b> — so price ticks up. Keep doing that and the candle closes up, above the area where sellers used to wait.":"着急的买家会吃掉价格上方的卖单。只要某个价格上的卖单比买入需求大，价格就守得住。当需求吃掉该价格上的最后一张卖单，下一张卖单在<b class=\"text-white\">更高处</b>，所以价格跳涨一个跳动点。一直这样下去，K线就会收涨，收在卖家原来等待的区域上方。","CDL · CDS":"CDL · CDS","Candle break engine":"K线突破引擎","Candle break illustration":"K线突破示意图","Clean chart, your rules":"干净的图表，你的规则","Control changes hands. The side that was defending the trend gets broken at the level it had to hold. <b class=\"text-white\">CDL</b> = buyers take over. <b class=\"text-white\">CDS</b> = sellers take over. It starts a new leg: <b class=\"text-white\">T{0}</b>.":"控制权易手。原来守着趋势的一方，在它必须守住的价位被打破。<b class=\"text-white\">CDL</b> = 买方接管。<b class=\"text-white\">CDS</b> = 卖方接管。新的一段开始：<b class=\"text-white\">T{0}</b>。","Crossing the marker = the break":"穿过标记 = 突破","Educational tools only, not financial advice. Indicators describe past and current price behaviour; they do not predict the future. Futures trading carries a high risk of loss.":"仅为教育工具，不是投资建议。指标描述的是过去和当前的价格行为，不能预测未来。期货交易的亏损风险很高。","Every MMM indicator speaks the same words, so you can move between them without learning anything new. The letter at the end tells you which engine made the call: <span class=\"num text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">c</span> candle, <span class=\"num text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">s</span> swing, <span class=\"num text-green-400\">x</span> zone.":"每个 MMM 指标用的都是同样的词，所以换着用也不用学新东西。末尾的字母告诉你是哪个引擎做出的判断：<span class=\"num text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">c</span>＝K线，<span class=\"num text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">s</span>＝波段，<span class=\"num text-green-400\">x</span>＝区域。","Every candle close":"每一根K线的收盘","Every candle that closes beyond the one before it is a vote. MMM Pro c keeps score of those votes: the last time buyers forced a close, the last time sellers did, and which of those closes the other side failed to take back. It also separates <b class=\"text-white\">urgent</b> moves — when one side was in such a hurry that it left price the other side never got to trade — from normal ones.":"每根收盘超出前一根的K线都算一票。MMM Pro c 会记下这些票：买方上一次推动收盘是什么时候，卖方上一次是什么时候，以及对方没能夺回其中哪一次收盘。它还会把<b class=\"text-white\">急迫的</b>走势——一方太着急，留下了另一方从没机会交易的价格——和普通走势分开。","Every trade needs a buyer and a seller. What matters is <b class=\"text-white\">who is in a hurry</b>. One side sends market orders and takes what is on offer. The other side waits with limit orders and lets the price come to them.":"每笔交易都需要买方和卖方。重要的是<b class=\"text-white\">谁更着急</b>。一方发市价单，吃掉对面挂着的单。另一方挂限价单等着，让价格自己过来。","Everything inside the current trend range is drawn; outside it, you decide how much history to keep. A level and its break always leave together.":"当前趋势范围内的一切都会画出来；范围之外，由你决定保留多少历史。一个价位和它的突破总是一起消失。","Fastest":"最快","Fewer, graded":"更少，带评分","Fewest":"最少","Fits":"适合","Get access on Whop":"在 Whop 获取使用权限","Higher timeframe inside your chart":"图表内的更高周期","Higher-timeframe bias":"高周期偏向","How price really moves":"价格真正是怎么动的","It gives <b class=\"text-white\">no arrows and no signals</b>. It shows the map and what three years of NQ and ten fresh months of MNQ say about it, and you decide. Everything is deleted when it is used up, and only closed candles count: no repaint.":"它<b class=\"text-white\">没有箭头，也没有信号</b>。它只展示地图，以及三年的 NQ 和十个月新鲜的 MNQ 数据对它的说法，由你来决定。用完的东西都会删除，只算已收盘的K线：不重绘。","It only moves when one team pulls harder than the other team can hold.":"只有当一队拉得比另一队守得住的更用力时，它才会动。","LD · SD":"LD · SD","MMM Pro":"MMM Pro","MMM Pro <b class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">c</b> answers it candle by candle. MMM Pro <b class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">s</b> answers it swing by swing. MMM Pro <b class=\"text-green-400\">x</b> answers it zone by zone. Same market, same language, three points of view.":"MMM Pro <b class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)]\">c</b> 一根K线一根K线地回答。MMM Pro <b class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)]\">s</b> 一个波段一个波段地回答。MMM Pro <b class=\"text-green-400\">x</b> 一个区域一个区域地回答。同一个市场，同一套语言，三种视角。","MMM Pro <span class=\"num\">XCS</span> One":"MMM Pro <span class=\"num\">XCS</span> One","MMM Pro <span class=\"num\">c</span>":"MMM Pro <span class=\"num\">c</span>","MMM Pro <span class=\"num\">s</span>":"MMM Pro <span class=\"num\">s</span>","MMM Pro <span class=\"num\">x</span>":"MMM Pro <span class=\"num\">x</span>","MMM Pro c":"MMM Pro c","MMM Pro c · s · x - The MMM Order-Flow Indicators | MMM Trading":"MMM Pro c · s · x - MMM 订单流指标 | MMM Trading","MMM Pro s":"MMM Pro s","MMM Pro x":"MMM Pro x","MMM Pro x maps those balance zones as boxes and colours them by who absorbed the most inside: accumulation, distribution or neutral. Only the boxes that hold a role in the trend — the pullback and the resumption — can make a break count. A body close out of the right box is a vote on <b class=\"text-white\">value</b>, not just on price.":"MMM Pro x 把这些平衡区画成框，并按里面谁吸收得最多来着色：吸筹、派发或中性。只有在趋势中承担角色的框——回调和恢复——才能让突破算数。实体收盘离开正确的框，是对<b class=\"text-white\">价值</b>的一次投票，而不只是对价格。","Markets breathe. After a strong push, buyers and sellers usually agree on a fair price for a while and rotate inside a range — that is <b class=\"text-white\">balance</b>, or contraction. Then one side wins the argument and price leaves — that is <b class=\"text-white\">imbalance</b>, or expansion.":"市场会呼吸。一波强力推动之后，买卖双方通常会在一段时间内认同一个合理价格，在区间里来回转。这就是<b class=\"text-white\">平衡</b>，也叫收缩。然后一方赢下争论，价格离开。这就是<b class=\"text-white\">失衡</b>，也叫扩张。","Medium":"中等","Meet the three engines":"认识三个引擎","Most":"最多","Most closes are noise. A few happen at the exact place where control was being defended. Finding <b class=\"text-white\">those</b> closes is what the three engines do.":"大多数收盘只是噪音。少数几根发生在控制权正被防守的那个确切位置。找出<b class=\"text-white\">那些</b>收盘，就是三个引擎做的事。","New · the universal map · v{0}":"新品 · 通用地图 · v{0}","New: <a href=\"#xcs-one\" class=\"font-bold text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)] hover:underline\">MMM Pro XCS One</a> puts all three engines in one chart · <a href=\"/backtests/\" class=\"font-bold text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)] hover:underline\">see every backtest</a>":"新品：<a href=\"#xcs-one\" class=\"font-bold text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)] hover:underline\">MMM Pro XCS One</a> 把三个引擎放进同一张图表 · <a href=\"/backtests/\" class=\"font-bold text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)] hover:underline\">查看所有回测</a>","News on the chart":"图表上的新闻","No repaint":"不重绘","None: a map, you decide":"没有：只给地图，由你决定","One-chart traders":"单图表交易员","Only closed candles count. What you see in the past is exactly what you would have seen live.":"只算已收盘的K线。你在过去看到的，正是你在实时会看到的。","Open the backtests":"打开回测","Order-flow idea":"订单流的想法","Premium &amp; discount gate":"溢价 &amp; 折价过滤","Price only moves when one side runs out of the other side's orders":"只有当一方吃光了另一方的订单，价格才会动","Price visited a level, but the other side answered and pushed it back. The orders there were <b class=\"text-white\">tested</b>, not beaten.":"价格来到一个价位，但对方回应并把它推了回去。那里的订单被<b class=\"text-white\">测试</b>了，但没有被击败。","Range and value traders":"区间与价值型交易员","Reads":"读取","Reads control <b class=\"text-white\">at the turning points</b>.":"<b class=\"text-white\">在转折点</b>读取控制权。","Reads control <b class=\"text-white\">between balance and imbalance</b>.":"<b class=\"text-white\">在平衡与失衡之间</b>读取控制权。","Reads control <b class=\"text-white\">one candle at a time</b>.":"<b class=\"text-white\">一根K线一根K线地</b>读取控制权。","SL s · stop lives here":"SL s · 止损放这里","Same auction. Three ways to read who is winning it.":"同一场拍卖。三种方式读出谁在赢。","Scalpers, precise entries":"剥头皮交易员，精准入场","See what was tested behind every number →":"查看每个数字背后测试了什么 →","See when a break goes with or against the bigger picture, read by any of the three engines.":"看一次突破是顺着还是逆着大局，三个引擎中任何一个都能读出来。","Sell demand meets buy offers":"卖出需求遇上买入报价","Sellers in a hurry hit the buy orders resting below price. When sell demand eats the last buy order at a price, the next buyer is <b class=\"text-white\">lower</b> — so price ticks down. Keep doing that and the candle closes down, below the area where buyers used to defend.":"着急的卖家会砸向价格下方挂着的买单。当卖出需求吃掉该价格上的最后一张买单，下一个买家在<b class=\"text-white\">更低处</b>，所以价格跳跌一个跳动点。一直这样下去，K线就会收跌，收在买家原来防守的区域下方。","Signals":"信号","Slowest, most selective":"最慢，最挑剔","Speed":"速度","Start the free course":"开始免费课程","Step {0} · one language for all three":"第 {0} 步 · 三者共用一套语言","Step {0} · the auction":"第 {0} 步 · 拍卖","Step {0} · three engines":"第 {0} 步 · 三个引擎","Structure traders":"结构型交易员","Swing break engine":"波段突破引擎","Swing break illustration":"波段突破示意图","Tested before they are sold":"卖之前先测试","The <b class=\"text-white\">origin</b> of a move — where the winning side started its push. It stays on the chart until price closes back through it.":"一波走势的<b class=\"text-white\">起点</b>——赢的一方开始推动的位置。它会一直留在图表上，直到价格收盘重新穿回它。","The Continuation":"延续","The Flip":"反转","The candle ended beyond the level. The market <b class=\"text-white\">accepted</b> the new price. The defenders there were absorbed or gave up.":"K线收在了价位的另一侧。市场<b class=\"text-white\">接受了</b>新价格。那里的防守方被吸收了，或者放弃了。","The foundation of MMM order flow":"MMM 订单流的基础","The free MMM Mastery Course teaches the order-flow ideas behind all three engines. Access to the indicators opens on TradingView by invitation through Whop.":"免费的 MMM Mastery Course 教你这三个引擎背后的订单流思路。指标的使用权限通过 Whop 以邀请方式在 TradingView 上开通。","The indicators read structure; they do not promise trades. Before launch, every signal type is tested against every entry, every stop and every exit, one by one, with out-of-sample checks. Only the combinations that survive go into the entry tools. No arrows that look good only in hindsight.":"指标读取的是结构，不承诺交易。上线前，每一种信号都会与每一种入场、每一种止损、每一种出场逐个组合测试，并做样本外检验。只有存活下来的组合才会进入入场工具。没有那种只在事后看起来漂亮的箭头。","The live range: the <b class=\"text-white\">pullback</b> the trend must break to continue, and the <b class=\"text-white\">resumption</b> base that becomes the next origin.":"当前区间：趋势要继续就必须突破的<b class=\"text-white\">回调</b>，以及会变成下一个起点的<b class=\"text-white\">恢复</b>基底。","The marker on the ground = the level":"地上的标记 = 价位","The rope = price":"绳子 = 价格","The rope crossed the line and stayed there at the end of the candle. Control changed hands — or the winning team pulled further.":"绳子越过了这条线，并在K线结束时停在那里。控制权易手了——或者赢的一队拉得更远了。","The side in control proves it again. After a pullback, it breaks through the counter-attack and resumes. <b class=\"text-white\">LD</b> = long delivery, <b class=\"text-white\">SD</b> = short delivery. Each one adds a step to the leg: <b class=\"text-white\">T{0}, T{1}…</b>":"掌握控制权的一方再次证明了自己。回调之后，它突破反攻并继续。<b class=\"text-white\">LD</b> = long delivery，<b class=\"text-white\">SD</b> = short delivery。每一个都给这一段加一级：<b class=\"text-white\">T{0}, T{1}…</b>","The zones born from a flip (<b class=\"text-white\">eBlock</b>) and from a continuation (<b class=\"text-white\">iBlock</b>). Each lives exactly as long as its origin.":"由反转产生的区域（<b class=\"text-white\">eBlock</b>）和由延续产生的区域（<b class=\"text-white\">iBlock</b>）。每个区域的存活时间，和它的起点完全一样长。","Think of it like a tug of war":"把它想成拔河","Three indicators. One question: <b class=\"text-white\">who is in control of price right now, buyers or sellers, and where did control change hands?</b>":"三个指标，一个问题：<b class=\"text-white\">现在是谁在控制价格，买方还是卖方？控制权是在哪里易手的？</b>","TradingView indicators for ES / MES and NQ / MNQ futures · closed candles only, no repaint · launching on TradingView by invitation":"适用于 ES / MES 和 NQ / MNQ 期货的 TradingView 指标 · 只用已收盘K线，不重绘 · 在 TradingView 上通过邀请上线","Trend markers: where the current leg <b class=\"text-white\">started</b> and its <b class=\"text-white\">newest</b> step. Everything between them is always drawn.":"趋势标记：当前这一段<b class=\"text-white\">从哪里开始</b>，以及它<b class=\"text-white\">最新的</b>一级。它们之间的一切始终都会画出来。","Turning points (swings)":"转折点（波段）","Two events tell the whole story":"两个事件讲完整个故事","What was tested, what works, what doesn’t · NQ {0}–{1} + fresh MNQ {2} · after costs":"测试了什么、什么有效、什么无效 · NQ {0}–{1} + 新鲜的 MNQ {2} · 扣除成本后","When a candle closes through the level the trend had to defend, you get the flip. When the trend pushes through its own pullback, you get the continuation — each one numbered, each one with its origin and its zone.":"当一根K线收盘穿过趋势必须守住的价位，就出现反转。当趋势冲破自己的回调，就出现延续——每一个都有编号，每一个都有自己的起点和区域。","Where the losing team made its last stand. That is where the MMM engines draw the origin of the move.":"失败的一队最后顽抗的地方。MMM 引擎就在那里画出这段走势的起点。","Which defenders got absorbed, with volume and delta behind it":"哪些防守方被吸收了，背后有成交量和 delta 支撑","Which one fits the way you trade?":"哪一个适合你的交易方式？","Which side forced the last close, and how urgently":"哪一方推动了最后的收盘，以及有多急","Which side won the argument about value":"哪一方赢得了对价值的争夺","Whichever engine you pick, you get the same professional toolkit around it.":"不管你选哪个引擎，周围都配有同一套专业工具。","XCS One":"XCS One","XCS One runs the zone engine <b class=\"text-green-400 num\">x</b>, the candle engine <b class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)] num\">c</b> and the swing engine <b class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)] num\">s</b> together. The boxes show where price is parked and who is winning inside them. The candle layer shows what the last candles mean and the tested odds of the next one. The swing layer shows where your stop belongs.":"XCS One 同时运行区域引擎<b class=\"text-green-400 num\">x</b>、K线引擎<b class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-gold-light)] num\">c</b>和波段引擎<b class=\"text-[color:var(--mmm-tiffany-light)] num\">s</b>。框显示价格停在哪里，以及框里谁在赢。K线层显示最近几根K线的含义，以及下一根的已测试胜率。波段层显示你的止损该放在哪里。","XCS One: a balance box with buyer and seller control lines, a GMC line and a swing protected level":"XCS One：带有买卖双方控制线的平衡框、一条 GMC 线和一个波段保护位","Zone speed, candle detail":"区域的速度，K线的细节","balance (contraction)":"平衡（收缩）","buyers {0}%":"买方 {0}%","close beyond = vote":"收盘在外 = 一票","close out = imbalance":"收盘在外 = 失衡","close through = break":"收盘穿过 = 突破","eBlock · iBlock":"eBlock · iBlock","level to defend":"要守住的价位","live box (x)":"当前框 (x)","sellers":"卖方","swing high":"波段高点","swing low = origin":"波段低点 = 起点","★ GMC":"★ GMC"}